OL,3,GNEWSA'Time for new start' after #150k
OL,4,Apublic hall sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's mayor said it is "time for a
OL,7,Fnew beginning", after a public hall in
OL,8,FShropshire was sold for #150,000, a
OL,9,Fmeeting heard.
OL,11,FResidents voted to dispose of the
OL,12,Fbuilding on Station Street in Bishop's
OL,13,FCastle at a previous public meeting in
OL,14,FJuly, with the town council ratifying
OL,15,Fthe decision.
OL,17,FThe next step is to form a committee to
OL,18,Fbuild a new public hall.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
