OL,3,GNEWSA'Time for new start' after #150k
OL,4,Apublic hall sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FBishop's Castle's mayor, councillor
OL,7,FJosh Dickin, said someone had already
OL,8,Foffered the potential to donate some
OL,9,Fland, which he said was "in a
OL,10,Fpicturesque location" and within
OL,11,Fwalking distance.
